        {
          "text": " Omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akainamuka, Yehoyakimu yaamwehongyera, yaamara emyaka eshatu ari omwiru we; bwanyima yaamuhinduka, yaamugomera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
