        },
        {
          "text": " Yehoyakiini akaza aha ngoma aine emyaka ikumi na munaana, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu ameezi ashatu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Nehushiita, muhara wa Elinasani owa Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
